## Summary

This notebook provides a complete, ready-to-use Gradio web application for clinical vitals prediction using camera-based rPPG technology. The system integrates:

1. **MediaPipe Tasks API** for efficient face landmark detection
2. **SpatioTemporalPhysNet** (3D-CNN) for PPG waveform extraction from 10 facial ROIs
3. **ClinicalVitalsRegressor** for predicting 10 clinical vital signs
4. **Gradio** for an interactive, user-friendly web interface

The application can process both uploaded videos and live webcam streams, providing real-time visualization of the extracted PPG waveform and a comprehensive clinical health report.

**To use this notebook:**
1. Ensure all dependencies are installed
2. Place the model checkpoints in the correct locations
3. Run all cells to launch the web application
4. Access the interface at http://localhost:7860

